# Repo map (concise)

DataBossX = five apps sharing LLM/OCR pieces. Full detail:
`docs/AI_REPO_MAP.md`. Day-to-day runbook: `docs/RUNBOOK.md`.

- `backend/server.py` — FastAPI OCR+LLM API (SQLite, port 8001). OCR is mocked.
- `frontend/` — React (CRA) UI; calls backend via `REACT_APP_BACKEND_URL`.
- `automation/playwright_bot.py` — Weld County recorder scraper + status engine
  (`status_logic.py`, `parsing.py`, `writer.py`); config in `config/settings.toml`.
- `doto_image_commander/` — Streamlit OK-county download/OCR workflow (paid APIs;
  cost tracking + Fernet key mgmt in `core/`).
- `mineral_deal_room/` — Vite/React/TS dashboard on local sample data.

Key commands:
- Doctor: `python scripts/doctor.py`
- Tests/lint: `python scripts/test_all.py`  (unit suite in `tests/`)
- Security: `python scripts/security_scan.py`
- Backend: `cd backend && uvicorn server:app --reload --port 8001`
- Frontend: `cd frontend && yarn start` · Mineral room: `yarn dev`

Env var names: see `docs/AI_REPO_MAP.md` ("Environment variables"). Never inline
real values.
